<title>USA: AMEX to open Kimberly-Clark LEAPS on August 6.</title>
<headline>AMEX to open Kimberly-Clark LEAPS on August 6.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Tuesday trading in LEAPS (long term equity anticipation securities) on Kimberly-Clark Corp will begin on August 6.</p>
<p>Last week the exchange said it planned to open trading in Kimberly Clark LEAPS on August 4.</p>
<p>The LEAPS will have strike prices of 40, 50 and 60, with expirations in January 1999 and January 2000.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
